    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE COMMUNITY</h1><p><br>Join us and be a part of the development of NanoHive and Tower of Sins (our next game)</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>NanoHive is a fast-paced top-down shooter playing out inside of a human body. You are the Operator of a high-tech hive of nanobots with only one goal in mind, eradicating all the pesky bacteria and viruses as fast as possible.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/b109e53696fe58b7b4e5c10e9a0a1eab.poster.avif?t=1664573659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/b109e53696fe58b7b4e5c10e9a0a1eab.webm?t=1664573659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/b109e53696fe58b7b4e5c10e9a0a1eab.mp4?t=1664573659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Explore and disinfect the different organs.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/73f89c9e923bcc9ee594285da95a4eb4.poster.avif?t=1664573659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/73f89c9e923bcc9ee594285da95a4eb4.webm?t=1664573659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/73f89c9e923bcc9ee594285da95a4eb4.mp4?t=1664573659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Your tool is also your most important resource. Nanobots act as your health, ammunition and fuel. Manage them carefully.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/ffda82a9e8ba6c0cd1dc5718b310d660.poster.avif?t=1664573659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/ffda82a9e8ba6c0cd1dc5718b310d660.webm?t=1664573659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/ffda82a9e8ba6c0cd1dc5718b310d660.mp4?t=1664573659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Nanobots are designed to absorb the organic matter present in bacteria so that they can multiply themselves.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/b05a0f61212f29d9f3d491dd5f1b35e6.poster.avif?t=1664573659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/b05a0f61212f29d9f3d491dd5f1b35e6.webm?t=1664573659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/b05a0f61212f29d9f3d491dd5f1b35e6.mp4?t=1664573659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You need to be as fast as possible when lives are on the line. Being faster than the other Operators on the leaderboard doesn't hurt either.",
    "about_the_game": "NanoHive is a fast-paced top-down shooter playing out inside of a human body. You are the Operator of a high-tech hive of nanobots with only one goal in mind, eradicating all the pesky bacteria and viruses as fast as possible.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/b109e53696fe58b7b4e5c10e9a0a1eab.poster.avif?t=1664573659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/b109e53696fe58b7b4e5c10e9a0a1eab.webm?t=1664573659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/b109e53696fe58b7b4e5c10e9a0a1eab.mp4?t=1664573659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Explore and disinfect the different organs.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/73f89c9e923bcc9ee594285da95a4eb4.poster.avif?t=1664573659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/73f89c9e923bcc9ee594285da95a4eb4.webm?t=1664573659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/73f89c9e923bcc9ee594285da95a4eb4.mp4?t=1664573659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Your tool is also your most important resource. Nanobots act as your health, ammunition and fuel. Manage them carefully.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/ffda82a9e8ba6c0cd1dc5718b310d660.poster.avif?t=1664573659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/ffda82a9e8ba6c0cd1dc5718b310d660.webm?t=1664573659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/ffda82a9e8ba6c0cd1dc5718b310d660.mp4?t=1664573659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Nanobots are designed to absorb the organic matter present in bacteria so that they can multiply themselves.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/b05a0f61212f29d9f3d491dd5f1b35e6.poster.avif?t=1664573659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/b05a0f61212f29d9f3d491dd5f1b35e6.webm?t=1664573659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1995320/extras/b05a0f61212f29d9f3d491dd5f1b35e6.mp4?t=1664573659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You need to be as fast as possible when lives are on the line. Being faster than the other Operators on the leaderboard doesn't hurt either.",
